      "side": 1,
      "message": "It should be possible (and hopefully pretty trivial) to add compile targets for the tests which build and install this automatically. There is already a target for using `trichrome_chrome_64_32_bundle` https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:tools/perf/chrome_telemetry_build/BUILD.gn;l\u003d164",
      "range": {
